ToApp Lite is an independent clean-room rewrite created for private/internal use.
It does not contain code, assets, signing keys, analytics SDKs, or remote service
integrations from the uploaded ToApp APK.

Third-party dependency:
- apksig-android by Muntashir Al-Islam / Android apksig-derived code.
  Review its upstream license before redistribution.

WebtoApp optional ad filtering
------------------------------
Generated apps can retrieve EasyList, EasyList China, AdGuard Mobile Ads and
CJX Annoyance List from their original public URLs. Full source and licence
references are embedded at shell/src/main/assets/adblock/THIRD_PARTY_FILTERS.md.
No complete third-party filter list is bundled in the WebtoApp source archive.
